{
  "id": 42,
  "description": "Welcome to the guild Magazyn Ryb.\n\n🐟🐟🐟🐟\n\nThe guild was created on March 8 2024\n\n🐟🐟🐟🐟\n\nEvery story has great heroes, fire-breathing dragons, trolls, monsters, and more.\nBut who provides all the logistics? Who cuts up and transports the sea monster? Who will lend a barge to ferry gold and supplies to the local dwarves.\nOur guild are just such heroes. We are engaged in logistics and selling fishing gear, provide cities with fresh fish, bring fresh squid on our ships and so on.\nYes, friends, we are the Fish Depot (Magazyn Ryb - polish version).",
